  "sourceTitle": "Boysenberry Sauce",
  "sourceText": "Boysenberry Sauce\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Tuesday, December 1, 2009 - 12:39am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n10 ounces Boysenberries (red) Frozen\n1 1/2 teaspoons Cornstarch\n1/2 cup Boysenberry Jam\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Thaw and crush frozen berries. Combine with cornstarch. Add jam. Heat to boiling. Cook and stir until clear and slightly thick. Strain and cool.",
